{"3593330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Plush Rangers", "steam_appid": 3593330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plush Rangers</strong> is a fast-paced survivors-like where you assemble a team of <strong>Plushie Friends</strong> to battle quirky mutated enemies. Toasters have gone haywire and staplers are possessed. Beat them back with bowling balls, orange slices, and carrot grenades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/d6a0ab9bd75431c47f305cc04e09d76c.poster.avif?t=1788314316\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/d6a0ab9bd75431c47f305cc04e09d76c.webm?t=1788314316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/d6a0ab9bd75431c47f305cc04e09d76c.mp4?t=1788314316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Plushie Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will expand your team with different plushie friends. Each plushie has unique abilities and behaviors—from the defensive <strong>Brocco</strong>, who repels nearby enemies, to <strong>Tangelo</strong>, a charging berserker tortoise. Level up your plushies to boost their power and unlock new capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/2f1e54c1d4af310f234f9c609ef30a94.poster.avif?t=1788314316\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/2f1e54c1d4af310f234f9c609ef30a94.webm?t=1788314316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/2f1e54c1d4af310f234f9c609ef30a94.mp4?t=1788314316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Acquire Truly Unique Loot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go shopping during your run at Button's Shiny Crow shop! Button stocks a unique collection of hats, clothing, and accessories. Each item has attributes or abilities to help enhance your run. You will also come across<strong> challenges</strong> that will reward you with powerful relics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/f03153fe61d29ade4a6fddcce5888a66.poster.avif?t=1788314316\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/f03153fe61d29ade4a6fddcce5888a66.webm?t=1788314316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/f03153fe61d29ade4a6fddcce5888a66.mp4?t=1788314316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>6 different characters</strong> -</i> Customize your character with a specialized ranger gear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Collect 50+ unique plushies</strong></i> - Each plushie has a different ability.  Level them up to discover new synergies between your plushies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Achieve 150+ badges</strong> -</i> Each badge unlocks additional content, challenges, or improved capabilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Discover 75+ relic artifacts</i></strong><i> -</i> Relics provide bonuses and abilities during your run.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plush Rangers</strong> is a fast-paced survivors-like where you assemble a team of <strong>Plushie Friends</strong> to battle quirky mutated enemies. Toasters have gone haywire and staplers are possessed. Beat them back with bowling balls, orange slices, and carrot grenades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/d6a0ab9bd75431c47f305cc04e09d76c.poster.avif?t=1788314316\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/d6a0ab9bd75431c47f305cc04e09d76c.webm?t=1788314316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/d6a0ab9bd75431c47f305cc04e09d76c.mp4?t=1788314316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Plushie Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will expand your team with different plushie friends. Each plushie has unique abilities and behaviors—from the defensive <strong>Brocco</strong>, who repels nearby enemies, to <strong>Tangelo</strong>, a charging berserker tortoise. Level up your plushies to boost their power and unlock new capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/2f1e54c1d4af310f234f9c609ef30a94.poster.avif?t=1788314316\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://sh